<title>TUNISIA: Tunisia seeks 100,000 tonnes feed barley.</title>
<headline>Tunisia seeks 100,000 tonnes feed barley.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tunisia on Wednesday launched a tender for Friday for the purchase of four lots of feed barley of 25,000 tonnes each for shipment from September to November, traders said.</p>
<p>Shipment dates are: Dept 5-15, Oct 1-10, Oct 20-31 and Nov 20-30.</p>
<p>Deadline for submitting offers is Friday 0830 GMT, they added.</p>
<p>--Tunis newsroom, 216-1-787538</p>
</text>
